    "title": "Advanced Level Course on Teaching and Learning",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The Department for Educational Development at the Aga Khan University (AKU) is offering the second course of the series in Health Professions Education (HPE), the 'Advanced Level Course on Teaching and Learning', from August 15 to 25, 2006.",
    "media": [
