    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Department for Educational Development at the Aga Khan University (AKU) is offering the second course of the series in Health Professions Education (HPE), the 'Advanced Level Course on Teaching and Learning', from August 15 to 25, 2006."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This course is jointly developed and offered by the faculty from the Department for Educational Development with expert national and international visiting faculty. It comprises of two weeks of pre-reading, two weeks full-time intensive face-to-face participation on-site at AKU, followed by six weeks where participants return to work in their respective departments/ institutions and complete an application-based assignment based on problems in the participants own context and best evidence in medical education (BEME) available."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
